    "Chrome 优先生成自包含 MHTML；Safari 在大小上限内生成离线 HTML。应用未打开时，扩展会把待导入内容保留在浏览器本地队列，应用恢复后再重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome prefers self-contained MHTML, while Safari creates offline HTML within the size limit. If the app is closed, the extension keeps pending imports in its browser-local queue and retries when the app is available."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome 优先生成自包含 MHTML；Safari 在大小上限内生成离线 HTML。应用未打开时，扩展会把待导入内容保留在浏览器本地队列，应用恢复后再重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chrome/Edge 优先生成自包含 MHTML；Firefox 在大小上限内生成离线 HTML。应用未打开时，扩展会把待导入内容保留在浏览器本地队列，应用恢复后再重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome and Edge prefer self-contained MHTML, while Firefox creates offline HTML within the size limit. If the app is closed, the extension keeps pending imports in its browser-local queue and retries when the app is available."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome/Edge 优先生成自包含 MHTML；Firefox 在大小上限内生成离线 HTML。应用未打开时，扩展会把待导入内容保留在浏览器本地队列，应用恢复后再重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chrome/Edge 优先生成自包含 MHTML；Safari 和 Firefox 在大小上限内生成离线 HTML。应用未打开时，扩展会把待导入内容保留在浏览器本地队列，应用恢复后再重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome and Edge prefer self-contained MHTML, while Safari and Firefox create offline HTML within the size limit. If the app is closed, the extension keeps pending imports in its browser-local queue and retries when the app is available."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome/Edge 优先生成自包含 MHTML；Safari 和 Firefox 在大小上限内生成离线 HTML。应用未打开时，扩展会把待导入内容保留在浏览器本地队列，应用恢复后再重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chrome/Edge 会优先生成自包含 MHTML 归档，同时提取文章正文用于全文与本地语义检索。图片、样式等资源保存在归档中；脚本不会作为检索文本执行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome and Edge create a self-contained MHTML archive when possible and extract article text for full-text and local semantic search. Images, styles, and other resources stay in the archive; scripts are not executed as searchable text."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome/Edge 会优先生成自包含 MHTML 归档，同时提取文章正文用于全文与本地语义检索。图片、样式等资源保存在归档中；脚本不会作为检索文本执行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chrome/Edge 会优先生成自包含 MHTML 归档；Firefox 会保存可检索正文与清理后的原始 HTML。两者都通过本机回环接口直接写入资料库，脚本不会作为检索文本执行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome and Edge create a self-contained MHTML archive when possible; Firefox saves searchable text and sanitized original HTML. Both write directly to the library through the local loopback interface, and scripts are never executed as searchable text."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome/Edge 会优先生成自包含 MHTML 归档；Firefox 会保存可检索正文与清理后的原始 HTML。两者都通过本机回环接口直接写入资料库，脚本不会作为检索文本执行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chrome/Edge 会优先生成自包含 MHTML 归档；Firefox 会在 24 MB 上限内将可读取的图片、样式和字体内联为离线 HTML，并报告未能内联的外部资源。应用暂时未连接时，插件会在自己的本地队列中保留待导入内容，恢复后自动重试。脚本不会作为检索文本执行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome and Edge create a self-contained MHTML archive when possible. Firefox inlines readable images, styles, and fonts into offline HTML within a 24 MB limit and reports external resources that could not be inlined. When the app is temporarily unavailable, the extension keeps pending imports in its own local queue and retries automatically after reconnection. Scripts are never executed as searchable text."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome/Edge 会优先生成自包含 MHTML 归档；Firefox 会在 24 MB 上限内将可读取的图片、样式和字体内联为离线 HTML，并报告未能内联的外部资源。应用暂时未连接时，插件会在自己的本地队列中保留待导入内容，恢复后自动重试。脚本不会作为检索文本执行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chrome/Edge 在扩展管理页启用开发者模式并加载插件文件夹；Firefox 打开 about:debugging#/runtime/this-firefox，选择“临时载入附加组件”，再选中插件文件夹里的 manifest.json。首次连接时，把上面的令牌粘贴到插件中。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On Chrome or Edge, enable Developer Mode on the extensions page and load the extension folder. On Firefox, open about:debugging#/runtime/this-firefox, choose Load Temporary Add-on, then select manifest.json in the extension folder. For the first connection, paste the token above into the extension."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome/Edge 在扩展管理页启用开发者模式并加载插件文件夹；Firefox 打开 about:debugging#/runtime/this-firefox，选择“临时载入附加组件”，再选中插件文件夹里的 manifest.json。首次连接时，把上面的令牌粘贴到插件中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
