            "value": "The Safari extension is installed with RepoPress and only needs to be enabled in Safari Settings. The Chrome extension updates independently, with no separate Mac app edition."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Safari 扩展随 RepoPress 一起安装，只需在 Safari 设置中启用；Chrome 扩展独立更新，但不需要另做一个 Mac 应用版本。"
