    "只会删除当前用户的宿主清单和安装收据，不会删除浏览器插件或资料库内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the current user's host manifest and installation receipt will be removed. The browser extension and knowledge library content will remain untouched."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只会删除当前用户的宿主清单和安装收据，不会删除浏览器插件或资料库内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只会删除当前部署平台的独立钥匙串项，不会删除仓库访问令牌。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the current deployment platform's separate Keychain item will be deleted. The repository access token will remain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只会删除当前部署平台的独立钥匙串项，不会删除仓库访问令牌。"
          }
