    "安装操作只写入当前用户对应浏览器的 NativeMessagingHosts 目录，无需管理员权限。插件仍需连接令牌，原生宿主不能绕过资料库鉴权。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installation only writes to the selected browser's NativeMessagingHosts directory for the current user and does not require administrator privileges. The extension still needs a connection token, and the native host cannot bypass library authentication."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装操作只写入当前用户对应浏览器的 NativeMessagingHosts 目录，无需管理员权限。插件仍需连接令牌，原生宿主不能绕过资料库鉴权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安装操作只写入当前用户的 Firefox NativeMessagingHosts 目录；无需管理员权限。Firefox 插件仍需连接令牌，原生宿主不能绕过资料库鉴权。": {
