    "每日试用额度随系统日期自动重置；购买 Pro 终身会员可彻底解除上述限制。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Daily trial limits reset automatically based on device date; purchasing Pro Lifetime removes all limits."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每日试用额度随系统日期自动重置；购买 Pro 终身会员可彻底解除上述限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每条资料会导出为一个带元数据的 Markdown 文件；资料库本身不会被修改。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
