            "value": "These rules follow the current profile into AI chat, metadata suggestions, publishing checks, selection editing, and image alt/caption suggestions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些规则会随当前 Profile 进入 AI 聊天、元数据建议、发布检查、选区编辑和图片 alt/caption 建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些规则会随当前站点配置进入 AI 聊天、元数据建议、发布检查、选区编辑和图片替代文本/说明建议。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These rules follow the current site configuration into AI chat, metadata suggestions, publishing checks, selection editing, and image alt-text or caption suggestions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些规则会随当前站点配置进入 AI 聊天、元数据建议、发布检查、选区编辑和图片替代文本/说明建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这会从工作台移除「%@」，不会直接删除本地仓库里的文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes “%@” from the workbench without deleting files from the local repository."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会从工作台移除「%@」，不会直接删除本地仓库里的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这会删除资料库记录和检索索引，不会删除原始外部文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes the library record and search index without deleting the original external file."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会删除资料库记录和检索索引，不会删除原始外部文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这会清理资料库正文、网页归档、所有版本、标注、反向链接和检索索引。磁盘上的外部原始文件不会被删除，此操作无法撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This permanently removes stored text, webpage archives, all versions, annotations, backlinks, and search indexes. External source files on disk are not deleted. This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会清理资料库正文、网页归档、所有版本、标注、反向链接和检索索引。磁盘上的外部原始文件不会被删除，此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
