    "连接令牌有效 30 天；过期或手动更换后，旧令牌会立即失效，插件需要重新配对。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connection tokens are valid for 30 days. Expired or manually rotated tokens stop working immediately, and the extension must be paired again."
